---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import InterpretiveFrame from '../../components/interp/InterpretiveFrame';
import ScenarioView, { ScenarioBanner } from '../../components/interp/ScenarioView';
import ScenarioRing from '../../components/interp/ScenarioRing';
import { siteData } from '../../lib/site-data';
import { scenarioSources } from '../../lib/scenario-payload';

const data = await siteData();
const scenarios = data.scenarios;
const sources = scenarioSources(scenarios, data.sources);
const illustration = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((order) => ({ order, description: 'An illustrative step, not from any scenario' }));
---
<Base title="Scenarios" description="What a passage describes under one named reading tradition. Derived from scripture text only. Not a forecast.">
  <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl">Scenarios</h1>
  <div class="mt-3"><ScenarioBanner /></div>

  <section class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-6 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr]">
    <figure>
      <ScenarioRing steps={illustration} label="How a scenario is drawn: numbered steps around a ring, evenly spaced, with no time axis" illustrative />
      <figcaption class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">How each scenario is drawn. An illustration, not a scenario.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="max-w-[var(--measure-prose)] text-sm text-ink-secondary">
      <p>A scenario sets out the sequence a passage describes, read through one named tradition. Steps are numbered and evenly spaced around a ring. The ring has no time axis on purpose: nothing here says when, or whether, anything will happen.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Rules every scenario follows</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
        <li>Drawn from the text of scripture alone. No event data, statistics or news feed into it.</li>
        <li>Titled as a condition: "If the … reading of … is applied".</li>
        <li>No dates, no countdowns, no time windows. The build fails on any. A passage's own figures are shown as the text's, and are not converted to dates.</li>
        <li>No living people, officials or companies.</li>
        <li>Each states what it does not claim, and lists major objections with their sources.</li>
        <li>Published only after a named human reviewer approves it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3">Why: see <a class="text-accent underline" href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-xl">Published scenarios</h2>
    {scenarios.length === 0 ? (
      <p class="mt-3 rounded-md border border-dashed border-interp-rule p-4 text-sm text-ink-secondary">
        No scenarios are published yet. Drafts exist only for human review; a scenario appears here after a named reviewer approves it.
      </p>
    ) : (
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-6">
        {scenarios.map((s) => (
          <li>
            <InterpretiveFrame title="Scenario">
              <ScenarioView scenario={s} sources={sources} linkToDetail />
            </InterpretiveFrame>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    )}
  </section>
</Base>
